<title>SOUTH KOREA: Samsung wins $170 mln oil tanker orders.</title>
<headline>Samsung wins $170 mln oil tanker orders.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Samsung Heavy Industries Co Ltd said on Wednesday it had won $170 million in orders to build two 310,000-tonne ultra large crude oil carriers from Chevron Corp.  </p>
<p>scheduled to deliver one carrier in October 1999 and another in March 2000, a company statement said.</p>
<p>Samsung expected more shipbuilding orders from Chevron as a result of this deal, it said.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
</text>
